      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "在他的头上抚摸了一下"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-19",
      "text": "孙悟空像被雷劈一样跳起，举着棒子对唐僧怒吼「你干什么！」，冷雨浇在他身上冒出丝丝白气。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": null
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-20",
      "text": "孙悟空咆哮称没有人敢碰他的头，质问唐僧是否因此轻视他；唐僧缩回手，并记起眼前这只猴并不是他少年时在山中常抚摸的那些猴子的同类。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0002/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0002"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "没有人敢碰我的头"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-21",
      "text": "唐僧低头轻声说「从没有人……是的，你没有父母，我忘了。」并说了抱歉；孙悟空举着金箍棒愣在那里，白马长嘶一声。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你没有父母，我忘了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-22",
      "text": "夜间火堆边，猪八戒问唐僧是否把袈裟丢了，并说那是观音给他的护体袈裟。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "那可是观音给你的护体袈裟"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-23",
      "text": "唐僧答说袈裟「特别吸引妖精，丢了它就能护体，真是宝物」。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "特别吸引妖精"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-24",
      "text": "猪八戒抱怨唐僧每夜拿袈裟给他盖上，结果所有蚊子全叮他。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": null
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-25",
      "text": "孙悟空躺着说梦话「好沉，好沉！」手在空中乱挥；猪八戒说「这猴子在五行山下被压出毛病来了」，唐僧说「何止是毛病！」。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "这猴子在五行山下被压出毛病来了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-26",
      "text": "猪八戒说「紧箍咒能压着他多久？紧箍儿怎么可能压住这样的一个人？还有那么多愿意用自己的命换他的自由的人。我想，迟早有一天……」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "紧箍儿怎么可能压住这样的一个人"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-27",
      "text": "猪八戒说「那一天他会消灭所有他面前的东西，包括你和我。」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0003/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0003"
      },
      "revealed_at": 58,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-003/ch-000058.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000058",
          "chapter_order": 58,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "包括你和我"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-28",
      "text": "唐僧两次表示在等「那一天」：先答「我也在等那一天」，又说「我知道，但我会等那一天。」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0001/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0001"
